{"learnerLanguage":"en","spokenSeconds":190,"turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Hello, I'm Daniel. First, listen to each sentence and repeat it exactly. You're at an orientation day in the student center. Welcome to the student center."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Welcome to the student center."},{"speaker":"character","text":"The cafeteria is open until nine tonight."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"The cafeteria is open until nine tonight."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Club tables are set up along the main hallway."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Club tables are set along the main hallway."},{"speaker":"character","text":"You'll need your ID to use the gym on the lower level."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"You need your ID to use the gym on the lower level."},{"speaker":"character","text":"The information desk can help you if you've lost something on campus."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"The information desk can help you if you lost something on campus."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Students who work part-time on campus should pick up their schedules this week."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Students who work part-time on campus should pick their schedules this week."},{"speaker":"character","text":"The workshop that was planned for Friday afternoon has been moved to the lecture hall next to the bookstore."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"The workshop that was planned for Friday has been moved to the lecture hall near the bookstore."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Thank you. Now a short interview for a study abroad scholarship. What are you studying now, or what would you like to study?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I'm studying business administration, I'm in my second year. I chose it because my family has a small restaurant and I want to help them to manage it better."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Describe a time you worked with a group on a project."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Last semester we had to make a marketing plan for a local shop. We were four people and at the beginning it was difficult, because everybody had different ideas. But we divided the tasks and in the end we got a good grade. I learned that is important to communicate."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Some people think students learn more by studying abroad than by staying at home. What do you think?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I think studying abroad is very useful, because you have to speak another language every day and you meet people from other cultures. But it is also expensive, so not everybody can do it. For me the experience is more important than the classes."},{"speaker":"character","text":"How do you think studying abroad will change in the next twenty years?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Maybe more students will study online with universities in other countries, so they don't need to travel. But I think people will still want to go, because living in another country is different than see it on a screen."}],"criteria":[{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"repetition","levelBand":null,"name":"Listen and Repeat","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"elaboration","levelBand":null,"name":"Elaboration","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"grammar","levelBand":null,"name":"Grammar","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"vocabulary","levelBand":null,"name":"Vocabulary","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"delivery","levelBand":null,"name":"Delivery","scope":"task","sound":true,"voiceOnly":true}],"task":{"brief":"Listen and Repeat, then Take an Interview, in a shorter call","minutes":{"max":5,"min":5},"name":"Speaking mock","role":"examiner"},"title":"TOEFL iBT Speaking","exam":"toefl"}